  "sourceHtml": "<p class=\"kicker\">Train</p>\n<h1>Session times</h1>\n<p class=\"meta\"><strong>Program:</strong> Gym<br><strong>Unit:</strong> minutes, mobility primer included</p>\n<p>Every session opens with the mobility primer. The hatched band on each bar is the gap between the low and high estimate for the main lifts.</p>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"sw mob\"></i>Mobility primer</span><span><i class=\"sw main\"></i>Main lifts, low estimate</span><span><i class=\"sw rng\"></i>Range up to the high estimate</span></div>\n<div class=\"chart\">\n<div class=\"trow\"><div class=\"thead\"><span><b>Lift A</b>Deadlift + lower power</span><span class=\"tval\">47–51 min</span></div><div class=\"track\"><i class=\"mob\" style=\"width:15.000%\"></i><i class=\"main\" style=\"width:63.333%\"></i><i class=\"rng\" style=\"width:6.667%\"></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"trow\"><div class=\"thead\"><span><b>Lift B</b>Bench/Pull/Press + core</span><span class=\"tval\">39–44 min</span></div><div class=\"track\"><i class=\"mob\" style=\"width:15.000%\"></i><i class=\"main\" style=\"width:50.000%\"></i><i class=\"rng\" style=\"width:8.333%\"></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"trow\"><div class=\"thead\"><span><b>Lift C</b>Squat + plyo</span><span class=\"tval\">47–51 min</span></div><div class=\"track\"><i class=\"mob\" style=\"width:15.000%\"></i><i class=\"main\" style=\"width:63.333%\"></i><i class=\"rng\" style=\"width:6.667%\"></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"axis\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"left:0%\">0</span><span style=\"left:25%\">15</span><span style=\"left:50%\">30</span><span style=\"left:75%\">45</span><span style=\"left:100%\">60</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"wide\"><thead><tr><th>Session</th><th>Mobility primer</th><th>Main lifts</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Lift A (Deadlift + lower power)</td><td>9</td><td>38–42</td><td>47–51</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Lift B (Bench/Pull/Press + core)</td><td>9</td><td>30–35</td><td>39–44</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Lift C (Squat + plyo)</td><td>9</td><td>38–42</td><td>47–51</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Weekly total (3 sessions)</td><td>27</td><td>106–119</td><td>133–146</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mobility Primer: ankle dorsiflexion, 90/90 hip switches, couch stretch, world&#x27;s greatest stretch, lateral lunge sweep, band lateral walks.</li>\n<li>Deadlift and Back Squat need full rest (~2-2.5 min between sets) — don&#x27;t shorten to save time.</li>\n<li>Box jumps and depth jumps need near-full recovery for jump quality — treat like main lifts, not accessories.</li>\n<li>Plan for 45-55 min on Lift A/C days and 40-50 min on Lift B as a practical round number.</li>\n<li>Real-world variable not included: equipment/rack availability at the gym.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"src\">These figures match gym_workout_time.xlsx.</p>"
